                        Bruce, Lyon, MacArthur, S/P, WE, and RA. A
                    handwritten note on the source text reads: “Approved by the Secretary, L[ivingston] T. M[erchant]”. Initialed
                    for the Secretary by Merchant.
                    Repeated to Geneva, eyes only for the Under Secretary.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d519-f2" n="2" xml:id="d519-f2-content">
